# The shelf, merged across both libraries: loans with the date they are due,
# holds with a place in the queue and the dates around it, each labelled with
# the library it came from.
clean
tap Library
wait-for My books
wait-for Due 11 September 2026
expect On hold
expect 1 at the front of the queue
expect not on your home server
clean
tap Waiting for you
wait-for 7th of 7 · 24 August to 24 October 2026
expect 1st of 4 · 24 August to 17 December 2026
expect BAnQ
expect when one is ready
expect from your library account
expect-missing Cancel hold
expect Page 1
clean
tap Back
wait-for My books
